# Exclude everything not needed by the Docker build of the FastAPI services.
# Reduces build context size + prevents accidental secret leakage into images
# (devops-analysis-report.md P2 — no .dockerignore previously meant .git and
# __pycache__ shipped with every build).
**/.git
**/.git/**
**/.github
**/.github/**
**/__pycache__
**/__pycache__/**
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.venv
**/.venv/**
**/venv
**/venv/**
**/.env
**/.envrc
**/*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate.*
**/terraform.tfstate*
**/*.log
**/ansible.log
**/autopilot.log
**/vigolium-report.html
**/semgrep-findings-report.md
**/findings.md
**/devops-analysis-report.md
**/k8s/
**/terraform/
**/ansible/
**/scripts/
**/.gitleaks.toml
**/files.md/
